{
  "id": "6aa9710de4d955ad77c9b168",
  "title": "Cosense用の本文フォントUserCSS",
  "created": 1789489430,
  "updated": 1789554799,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6aa9710de4d955ad77c9b168",
      "text": "Cosense用の本文フォントUserCSS",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789489430,
      "updated": 1789550960
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa9713e0000000000e82cf9",
      "text": "[UserCSS.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789489471,
      "updated": 1789489480
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa9711b0000000000e82cf7",
      "text": "関連：[RobotoよりUD系フォントのほうが見やすくないか？]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789489436,
      "updated": 1789489463
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa9711c0000000000e82cf8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789489437,
      "updated": 1789489437
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa971780000000000e82cff",
      "text": "[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789489529,
      "updated": 1789550701
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa658d0000000000eed1a9",
      "text": "　標準フォントの Roboto も Helvetica も本文テキスト用のフォントとしては微妙な感じがする",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789552014,
      "updated": 1789552950
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa65fd0000000000eed1aa",
      "text": "　　小型スクリーンは別",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789552127,
      "updated": 1789552952
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa662f0000000000eed1ab",
      "text": "　ので自分は個人UserCSSでフォント関連のスタイル指定を変更している",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789552176,
      "updated": 1789554511
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa60730000000000eed171",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789550708,
      "updated": 1789550708
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa69f20000000000eed1c8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789553139,
      "updated": 1789553139
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa606b0000000000eed170",
      "text": "[** 0. Cosense既定のフォント]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789550701,
      "updated": 1789553151
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa60870000000000eed172",
      "text": "　Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, [Hiragino Sans]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789550728,
      "updated": 1789550763
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa9714a0000000000e82cfa",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789489483,
      "updated": 1789489483
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa61c70000000000eed17c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551049,
      "updated": 1789551049
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa63930000000000eed1a2",
      "text": "[** 3. [Atkinson Hyperlegible Next]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551509,
      "updated": 1789552731
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa69570000000000eed1bb",
      "text": " [バリアブルフォント]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789552984,
      "updated": 1789553284
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa6a4e0000000000eed1ce",
      "text": " このフォントは [grade] に対応していない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789553232,
      "updated": 1789553232
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa69570000000000eed1bc",
      "text": "  `--text-axis` は weight に加算する",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789552984,
      "updated": 1789552992
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa6a4c0000000000eed1cd",
      "text": "　ダークモード：字間（letter-spacing）を調整すれば読みやすくなる",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789553229,
      "updated": 1789553229
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa6a490000000000eed1cb",
      "text": "　　和文等幅フォントの BIZ UDGothic もそのままだと行間が若干狭い",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789553226,
      "updated": 1789553226
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa63940000000000eed1a3",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551509,
      "updated": 1789551509
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa62880000000000eed181",
      "text": " code:atkinson.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551241,
      "updated": 1789551288
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa6a360000000000eed1c9",
      "text": "  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:ital,opsz,wght@0,14..32,100..900;1,14..32,100..900&family=Roboto+Flex:opsz,wdth,wght,GRAD,XOPQ,XTRA,YOPQ,YTDE,YTFI,YTLC,YTUC@8..144,25..151,100..1000,-200..150,96,468,79,-203,738,514,712&display=swap');",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789553207,
      "updated": 1789553209
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa62880000000000eed183",
      "text": "  .editor {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551241,
      "updated": 1789551241
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa676e0000000000eed1ae",
      "text": "  \tfont-stretch: var(--page-font-width, none);\tfont-width: var(--page-font-width, none);",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789552495,
      "updated": 1789552495
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa62a60000000000eed191",
      "text": " \t\tfont-weight: calc(400 + var(--text-axis, 0));",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551272,
      "updated": 1789551386
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa6c350000000000eed1d6",
      "text": " \t\tfont-family: \"Atkinson Hyperlegible Next\", \"Roboto Flex\", \"Roboto\", Helvetica, \"Arial\", \"Hiragino Sans\", sans-serif, var(--icons, AppIcons);",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789553718,
      "updated": 1789554799
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa6bf10000000000eed1d5",
      "text": " \t\tletter-spacing: 0.009em;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789553650,
      "updated": 1789553662
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa62940000000000eed184",
      "text": "  \t@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551254,
      "updated": 1789551257
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa62980000000000eed185",
      "text": "  \t\tfont-family: \"Atkinson Hyperlegible Next\", \"Roboto Flex\", \"Roboto\", Helvetica, \"Arial\", \"Hiragino Sans\", \"BIZ UDGothic\", sans-serif, var(--icons, AppIcons);",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551257,
      "updated": 1789554793
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa62980000000000eed186",
      "text": "  \t\tfont-size-adjust: .52;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551257,
      "updated": 1789551257
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa62980000000000eed187",
      "text": "  \t\t--text-axis: -45;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551257,
      "updated": 1789551257
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa62980000000000eed189",
      "text": "  \t\t--page-font-width: normal;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551257,
      "updated": 1789551257
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa62980000000000eed18a",
      "text": "  \t\tfont-variation-settings: none;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551257,
      "updated": 1789551257
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa62980000000000eed18b",
      "text": "  \t\tletter-spacing: 0.015em;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551257,
      "updated": 1789551502
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa62980000000000eed18c",
      "text": "  \t}",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551257,
      "updated": 1789551257
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa629d0000000000eed18d",
      "text": "  }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551262,
      "updated": 1789551266
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa6f870000000000eed210",
      "text": "  .stream a,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789554569,
      "updated": 1789554569
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa6f870000000000eed211",
      "text": "  .formula-line { font-family: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-width: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; letter-spacing: inherit; }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789554569,
      "updated": 1789554603
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa6f870000000000eed212",
      "text": "  strong:not(.level, .level-1) { font-stretch: inherit; letter-spacing: inherit; }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789554569,
      "updated": 1789554619
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa634d0000000000eed1a0",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789551438,
      "updated": 1789551440
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa6d060000000000eed20a",
      "text": "[@font-face]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789553928,
      "updated": 1789553979
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa6d290000000000eed20b",
      "text": "　size-adjust ──目視で Roboto とだいたい同じ高さにする",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789553963,
      "updated": 1789554021
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa6cc50000000000eed1d7",
      "text": " code:atkinson.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789553863,
      "updated": 1789553874
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa6cd30000000000eed1da",
      "text": "  /* latin-ext */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789553876,
      "updated": 1789553879
    },
    {
